# Agent factory

When the user asks for the **factory / orchestrator / полный пайплайн / разработчик+ревьюер+QA** for a plan step:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/landing-page-orchestrator/SKILL.md`.
2. Do not skip stages or open a PR until Developer PASS, Reviewer Approve, and QA PASS (or QA SKIPPED for non-UI). QA **BLOCKED** (P-001 pending, no layout reference) is not green.
3. Do not jump `## Next` in `docs/part-1-plan.md` / `docs/part-2-plan.md`. Do not invent Coffee House vs author project.

When the user gives **post-PR / post-review** layout or UI feedback on an open `feat/*` («докидывай правки», screenshots, checklist misses):

1. Same orchestrator skill → section **Post-user-review fix**.
2. Fix on the existing branch, re-run Reviewer + QA, commit, push to the open PR — do not open a second PR.

Individual roles (only when asked for that role alone):

- `.cursor/skills/landing-page-developer/SKILL.md`
- `.cursor/skills/landing-page-reviewer/SKILL.md`
